@@ -2050,0 +1361,11
+                    // coop: deathwall: a monster that has died and is falling, its knockback spent, drops straight down. The
+                    // knockback's direction stays in movement, and the wall check below looks ten units along it: against the
+                    // wall the killing hit threw it at, it stopped every tick and hung in the air until its death script gave
+                    // up (the bat's three seconds; Jep's playtest note 39). Only the check's direction changes: the step itself
+                    // has no sideways part at speed 0. DC_COOP_MUTATE=deathwall leaves it as retail, for the test's twin.
+                    if (monster[current_monster].hp <= 0 && monster[current_monster].falls != 0 && monster[current_monster].movement_speed == 0.0f &&
+                        !coop::Mutated("deathwall")) {
+                        monster[current_monster].movement[0] = 0.0f;
+                        monster[current_monster].movement[2] = 0.0f;
+                    }
